        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4.) If additional leave is requested upon expiration of the leave granted, or should the circumstances of the leave change, the University may, at its discretion, require the employee to obtain recertification. Such requests for subsequent certification shall be in writing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                326,
