        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6.) An employee who has been granted a Medical Leave shall be returned to the same or an equivalent position when the employee has been medically released to perform the essential assigned functions of his/her job. Failure to provide a medical release to return to work may result in the denial of reinstatement until after the employee submits the required medical release certification.",
