        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.) An employee on an approved Parental Leave may elect to use accrued compensatory time off in accordance with Article 12 - Hours of Work prior to beginning FMLA leave. An employee may elect to use accrued vacation time before taking a FMLA leave without pay. If the employee's vacation leave accrual is at maximum, the employee will be required to use at least 10% of the vacation leave credit prior to taking leave without pay.",
